sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Submission
    participant Course
    participant Enrollment
    participant Storage as Storage Mock
    participant DB as submission_db

    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/submissions + JWT
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate JWT cục bộ
    Gateway->>Submission: HTTP + trace/principal context
    Submission->>Course: Kiểm tra course
    Course-->>Submission: Course hợp lệ
    Submission->>Enrollment: Kiểm tra enrollment
    Enrollment-->>Submission: Enrolled = true
    Submission->>Storage: Lưu content / object
    Storage-->>Submission: Object reference
    Submission->>DB: Lưu submission metadata
    DB-->>Submission: Submission persisted
    Submission-->>Gateway: Submission representation
    Gateway-->>Client: 201 Created
